# A child forked after the thread pool started has none of the parent's
# worker threads, so the std::thread state those threads own (created in
# Pool::grow) has no reference left in the child. Bounded, one per worker.
{
   pool-thread-state-after-fork
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: definite
   fun:malloc
   fun:_Znwm
   ...
   fun:*Pool4grow*
}
